Xdummy
------

Xdummy is used by default from Debian trixie and Ubuntu resolute onwards,
older releases use Xvfb instead (see https://github.com/Xpra-org/xpra/issues/2834).

This can be changed by modifying the configuration file
/etc/xpra/conf.d/55_server_x11.conf

SEE ALSO

    https://github.com/Xpra-org/xpra/blob/master/docs/Usage/Xdummy.md

DPI

    If -dpi argument is not given, font size may be incorrect
    (too big or too small) unless session is attached
    before starting the applications.